<title>USA: International Paper Co Q1 EPS $0.11 vs $0.36.</title>
<headline>International Paper Co Q1 EPS $0.11 vs $0.36.</headline>
<dateline>PURCHASE, N.Y. 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.11		    $0.36</p>
<p> Net			 34,000		   98,000</p>
<p> Revs		   4,900,000		4,800,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 300,600		  268,900</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 results include an after-tax charge of $362 million, or $1.35 per share for restructuring costs and the impairment of assets.</p>
<p>The 1996 Q1 also include an after-tax gain of $336 million, or $1.25 a share, on the sale of a partnership interest.</p>
<p>Before special items, 1996 Q1 results were $124 million, or $0.46 per share.</p>
</text>
